      "translation": "自 4.5 版本起，请使用 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/mongodb/core/mapping/event/ValidatingEntityCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>ValidatingEntityCallback</code></a> 或 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/mongodb/core/mapping/event/ReactiveValidatingEntityCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>ReactiveValidatingEntityCallback</code></a>，以确保在遇到验证约束违规时能够正确控制保存操作的顺序并中断该操作。",
