    {
      "source": "since 5.0. Storing values as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> retains precision, but prevents\n            efficient range queries. Prefer <a href=\"org/springframework/data/mongodb/core/convert/MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.html#DECIMAL128\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.DECIMAL128</code></a> for better query support.",
      "translation": "自 5.0 版本起。将值存储为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 可以保留精度，但会妨碍高效的范围查询。建议优先使用 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/mongodb/core/convert/MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.html#DECIMAL128\"><code>MongoCustomConversions.BigDecimalRepresentation.DECIMAL128</code></a> 以获得更好的查询支持。",
